menu "CSI Sensor and Actuator Node"

config CSI_LIGHT_GPIO
    int "WS2812 data GPIO"
    range 0 39
    default 25

config CSI_LIGHT_LED_COUNT
    int "Number of WS2812 LEDs"
    range 1 64
    default 16

config CSI_LIGHT_MAX_BRIGHTNESS
    int "Maximum LED brightness (0-255)"
    range 1 255
    default 76
    help
        76 is about 30 percent and protects the 5 V power-bank budget.

endmenu
